      "id": "code:creative:histogram-tables",
      "filename": "histogram_tables.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "pbi-2026-w39/"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Create each calculated table separately; do not paste both definitions as a single measure. Width/axis ranges come from W39 practice instructions. Validate Desktop version.",
      "sha256": "8d3f6dddeaf7e05212ee97e4cc0b2b84d2204736b7016e77cdbad0536f0646cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "code:creative:histogram-count",
      "filename": "histogram_count.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "pbi-2026-w39/",
        "calculate-function-dax"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Requires Waits at one case per row, numeric WaitMinutes, disconnected helper tables and preserved Location/Date context. Widths must be strictly positive. Native total-row behavior and axis visibility require target-product testing.",
      "sha256": "fdba2351cc7e76d768d028a635c253ba9fae197897b92c496aba46b9e5d37c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "code:creative:field-parameter",
      "filename": "field_parameter.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "power-bi-field-parameters"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Illustrative schema bindings. Resolve actual model names and parameter metadata; pasting a generic DAX table alone is not proof of a working field parameter.",
      "sha256": "9a31ec6ed5898d85ddef5079e164a1d429767a6a64402db6278c594e65104d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "code:creative:midpoint-contributions",
      "filename": "midpoint_contributions.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "pbi-2026-w40/"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Four base measures must share scope and units. Define a reviewed policy for missing periods before using the identity; use an appropriate numeric tolerance. These are three separate measure definitions.",
      "sha256": "322bbc15b92a37e33b77044cd00d826c92d570fd45ba0efb0f28fc946d76d3cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "code:creative:safe-variance",
      "filename": "safe_variance.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "pbi-2026-w40/",
        "divide-function-dax"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Define Current/PY with comparable periods and filter context. DIVIDE defaults to BLANK for zero denominator; do not replace unavailable comparisons with observed zero.",
      "sha256": "350e45585b34005edaa530be6da36fce1673dc624762330bcb2ca23409f7667c"
    },
    {
      "id": "code:creative:svg-ratio",
      "filename": "svg_ratio.dax",
      "language": "dax",
      "evidence_source_patterns": [
        "pbi-2026-w38/",
        "divide-function-dax"
      ],
      "authorship": "DERIVED_EDUCATIONAL_TEMPLATE",
      "native_execution": "NOT_RUN",
      "requirements": "Define actual/target units and explicitly reject invalid negative targets if inappropriate. Provide numeric values and a non-color legend. SVG embedding/rendering is not validated by these measures.",
      "sha256": "4d60589bed3a399d0f362dd5064774464c9fd6ca25cf8f12a03d10c04e5e3440"
